### Create a todo (POST)
POST http://localhost:3000/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write API documentation",
  "description": "OpenAPI + README examples",
  "state": "todo"
}

### 2. Get all todos
GET http://localhost:3000/todos


### 3. Get todos by state (Filter)
GET http://localhost:3000/todos?state=todo

### 4. Get a single todo
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/bed434be-ea06-48cd-ac7a-6d0be363c594

### 5. Update a todo
PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/bed434be-ea06-48cd-ac7a-6d0be363c594
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "doing"
}


### 6. Delete a todo
DELETE http://localhost:3000/todos/bed434be-ea06-48cd-ac7a-6d0be363c594


### 7. Test 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:3000/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This should fail"
}


### 8. Test 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/12345